!Series_summary = To define the cellular composition and spatial architecture of the tumor micoenvironment, we combined single-cell RNA-sequencing, spatial transcriptomics, and multiplexed ion-beam imaging from 10 patient cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma tumors and  site-matched normal skin
